{"Date": "01/05/2018", "Record Number": "ZP2018-0003", "Record Type": "Zoning Permit", "Description": "Conversion of an already permitted remodel project (B2017-01370) into a new construction project. Replacement of a 1118 square-foot, one-story, single-family home without garage into a 1012 square-foot home with attached garage. The new structure has the same footprint as the existing structure plus a 134 square-foot addition in the rear. The former garage, currently conditioned space, will be converted back into a garage. The project includes a variance request for a six-foot incursion of the garage into the front yard setback, in conformance with all other properties on the block. The owners will pursue LEED Platinum and Passive House certifications.", "Project Name": "1609 Eighth Street", "Status": "Approved", "Action": "", "Expiration Date": "", "Short Notes": "", "_cells": ["", "01/05/2018", "ZP2018-0003", "Zoning Permit", "Conversion of an already permitted remodel project (B2017-01370) into a new construction project. Replacement of a 1118 square-foot, one-story, single-family home without garage into a 1012 square-foot home with attached garage. The new structure has the same footprint as the existing structure plus a 134 square-foot addition in the rear. The former garage, currently conditioned space, will be converted back into a garage. The project includes a variance request for a six-foot incursion of the garage into the front yard setback, in conformance with all other properties on the block. The owners will pursue LEED Platinum and Passive House certifications.", "1609 Eighth Street", "Approved", "", "", "", "1609 EIGHTH St, BERKELEY CA 94710"], "capdetail_href": "/BERKELEY/Cap/CapDetail.aspx?Module=Planning&TabName=Planning&capID1=18PLN&capID2=00000&capID3=00027&agencyCode=BERKELEY&IsToShowInspection="}
